(7570049, 1215060, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice action pseudo-progression of these young folk on the court, or driveway.  The direct gaze of the boy on the left disrupts expectation.  Friends hanging out in the neighborhood, doesn''t get better.  The tree makes a lovely background.</td>', 'Nice action pseudo-progression of these young folk on the court, or driveway.  The direct gaze of the boy on the left disrupts expectation.  Friends hanging out in the neighborhood, doesn''t get better.  The tree makes a lovely background.', '2018-06-02 20:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
