(7570052, 1215030, 173844, '<td valign="top">The perfect neighbors, bringing cake!  Has an impromptu feel and generosity that gladdens the heart.  Sweet.</td>', 'The perfect neighbors, bringing cake!  Has an impromptu feel and generosity that gladdens the heart.  Sweet.', '2018-06-02 20:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7570053, 1215028, 173844, '<td valign="top">Does Steve know you''re there?  You need good neighbors in the forest, so it''s important to have friends at hand.</td>', 'Does Steve know you''re there?  You need good neighbors in the forest, so it''s important to have friends at hand.', '2018-06-02 20:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7570054, 1215033, 173844, '<td valign="top">It''s interesting how being thrown together (as I''m assuming here) on vacation can evolve.  People are having a good time and extend themselves to be friendly.  Hope the dog is friendly too.  I like that sliver of beach.</td>', 'It''s interesting how being thrown together (as I''m assuming here) on vacation can evolve.  People are having a good time and extend themselves to be friendly.  Hope the dog is friendly too.  I like that sliver of beach.', '2018-06-02 20:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7570055, 1214959, 173844, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t cry out intimacy, but you''re certainly all thrown together and the usually transient relationships can prove surprisingly interesting.  I like the presentation of volume here.</td>', 'Doesn''t cry out intimacy, but you''re certainly all thrown together and the usually transient relationships can prove surprisingly interesting.  I like the presentation of volume here.', '2018-06-02 20:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7570056, 1214919, 173844, '<td valign="top">A good, friendly image.  She seems like the kind of neighbor you can say hi to every day and enjoy conversations.  The feel is that of a leisurely connection to time and space.</td>', 'A good, friendly image.  She seems like the kind of neighbor you can say hi to every day and enjoy conversations.  The feel is that of a leisurely connection to time and space.', '2018-06-02 20:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
